# Transition state search with IRC: reactant, product, TS search, frequencies, IRC.
recipe: ts-irc
title: TS search with IRC
field: Reactions
summary: Reactant and product, a TS search with frequencies, then the IRC
description: Optimises reactant and product with frequencies, finds the transition state between them and follows the reaction path from it in both directions. The Gaussian 16 variant starts the TS search from a relaxed scan (QST3); the ORCA variant runs an NEB-TS between reactant and product.
role: geom | Optimisations, TS search, frequencies, IRC | B3LYP | 6-31+G(d) | the usual starting level for barriers; diffuse functions when a species is an anion
role: solvent | Solvent | none | | gas phase by default; choose a solvent model when the reaction runs in solution
rules: anion-diffuse, heavy-ecp, size, registered

variant: g16 | Gaussian 16 (QST3) | G16
step: g16 | reactant | G16 | geom | GeoVib | Opt + Freq | structure, key=reactant, thermo
step: g16 | scan | G16 | geom | Geometry | relaxed scan from the reactant |
step: g16 | product | G16 | geom | GeoVib | Opt + Freq from the scan's last point | key=product, thermo
step: g16 | ts | G16 | geom | Transition State (QST) + Frequencies | QST3 + Freq | key=ts, thermo
step: g16 | irc | G16 | geom | IRC | IRC from the TS |
link: g16 | reactant | scan | geometry
link: g16 | scan | product | geometry.last
link: g16 | reactant | ts | reactant
link: g16 | product | ts | product
link: g16 | scan | ts | tsguess.max
link: g16 | ts | irc | geometry

variant: orca | ORCA (NEB-TS) | ORCA
step: orca | reactant | ORCA | geom | GeoVib | Opt + Freq | structure, key=reactant, thermo
step: orca | product | ORCA | geom | GeoVib | Opt + Freq | structure, key=product, thermo
step: orca | ts | ORCA | geom | Transition State (NEB-TS) + Frequencies | NEB-TS + Freq | key=ts, thermo
step: orca | irc | ORCA | geom | IRC | IRC from the TS |
link: orca | reactant | ts | reactant
link: orca | product | ts | product
link: orca | ts | irc | geometry
